# Fights at Orerve again, from another random state, and meets the Escape Pod, the Plate, an Anaconda, a Worm, a
# Sidewinder and a Cobra Mk III. It starts from combat-orerve-drifters.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the
# fighter (a military laser, ECM, an energy unit, 20 kills) with its random state 7,629,345 draws on. It finds
# Orerve on the short-range chart and jumps there. In space it holds J and full speed whenever no ship but a rock
# or a barrel is about: while the jump drive is engaged, ships of every class spawn 32 times as often
# (ScaleSpawnOdds) until a ship mass-locks the drive. The draw count was found by the search combat-orerve.replay
# describes, for the three combat replays together. The fight was played by a scratch program that steered at the
# nearest ship by its position each frame and fired when it was in the sights; what it pressed is recorded here
# like any other replay.
file JAMESON.CDR combat-orerve-drifters.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # D10, Disc access, on Load commander
key 1; wait 0.3                    # Load commander: the catalogue, JAMESON.CDR selected
key Return; wait 0.5               # loaded
